    "content": "<p>From now until <strong>July 29,</strong> you can battle on the new event map, <strong>Solidus Node: Foundry</strong>. This virtual environment is powered by Solidus and stripped of all metadata and visual markers that would pinpoint this node to any particular place. It may or may not represent a real high-value site somewhere in or outside the Wild Ten... The pay is good, though, so get to work.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Look out for Solidus Node: Foundry appearing in the map roster in all game modes.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/07/247-Week3Events/1.png\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Complete additional Daily and Weekly Jobs in a <strong>Special Job Event</strong>! Destroy War Robots and deal damage using specific Weapons (Halo, Tusk, Gemini) and Torso Modules (Loki, Scorpion, Cyclops) to <strong>earn Credits and Intel</strong> until July 29.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong><strong> </strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a> <strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One</strong></a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates.</p>",
